674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zFucXZ9eWFAQ7kNvwGX3FWr&_nc_oc=Adqe_IMWSTvy1wdZzH-TjnGuG30i3fy62pwINkLSyuDwd61ukrz-qf_o2S9Qlp9zKjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9E_vgVsyG0RAc5JAHJ2VDkSaWHaNx-JO7dP-Pjq_reAw&oe=6A297559"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJWEWaMAnncQ7kNvwGdPq3w&_nc_oc=Adr7LKe9y6p52p69LydVJ_ISMdCA9HwN4QOAKTPpRd3S9WcmfRxYYp4wtFzd7KTulzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9XDcXZ6AmZ83p7FaEJHWqIROtX_UtodMoxwzoKbEXR4g&oe=6A297E16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x3LHbuNf6C8Q7kNvwGRDR17&_nc_oc=Adqj9__MnbjUU4lD4ziT1gZL3jTQ2CQChj47q2-9IXIVNyT_DNYTIpLkLn7QMJh2RdY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_LqaOuUThUTB8cXLdlBTk05HYuFSMd3F9VhSxB1BC2kg&oe=6A297A31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip